{"availability":"available","full":"alvenyuka/Fraud-Detection-System","name":"Fraud-Detection-System","description":"Fraud classifier on 6.3M simulated PaySim mobile-money transactions. XGBoost with a time-based split: 99.9% precision and 99.6% recall on a 132K-row holdout (99.98% of fraud value stopped, 3 false alarms), walk-forward PR-AUC 0.997, live scoring demo.","category":"Finance","language":"Jupyter Notebook","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-04T08:39:51Z","updated":"2026-10-06T19:48:58Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://fraud-detection-alven.vercel.app","topics":["fintech","fraud-detection","jupyter-notebook","machine-learning","mobile-money","paysim","python","risk-modeling","shap","xgboost"],"demo":"https://fraud-detection-alven.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:28.674Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:28.674Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:28.674Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:25:28.674Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A model that flags fraudulent mobile-money transfers so they can be stopped before the money leaves. On 132,136 transactions it had never seen, it stopped 99.98% of the fraud value (the simulator's built-in flag stopped 1.1%), catching 2,742 of 2,754 frauds while wrongly flagging 3 legitimate ones. XGBoost trained on 6.3 million simulated PaySim transactions, with a live scoring demo.","Try it: live scoring page · dashboard (free host, allow about 30 seconds to wake)","In mobile money a fraud flag usually freezes the customer's funds. Every false alarm locks an honest customer out of their own money; every missed fraud is a direct loss. Fraud is about 0.13% of transactions, so a model that never flags anything is 99.87% accurate and useless. A fraud-operations team needs three answers from a model: how much fraud value it stops, how many honest customers it freezes to do so, and whether that holds up as time passes. This page answers them in that order."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alvenyuka/Fraud-Detection-System/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"20f3c7412ee1cf01277de003137295f1d9b58c0eeca149325fd6a1b6d82474d0","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:28.817Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:28.817Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A model that flags fraudulent mobile-money transfers so they can be stopped before the money leaves. On 132,136 transactions it had never seen, it stopped 99.98% of the fraud value (the simulator's built-in flag stopped 1.1%), catching 2,742 of 2,754 frauds while wrongly flagging 3 legitimate ones. XGBoost trained on 6.3 million simulated PaySim transactions, with a live scoring demo.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alvenyuka/Fraud-Detection-System/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"20f3c7412ee1cf01277de003137295f1d9b58c0eeca149325fd6a1b6d82474d0","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alvenyuka/Fraud-Detection-System/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:28.817Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T19:48:58Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alvenyuka/Fraud-Detection-System/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:28.818Z","hash":"20f3c7412ee1cf01277de003137295f1d9b58c0eeca149325fd6a1b6d82474d0","originalBytes":10453,"storedBytes":10453,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["fraud","model","threshold","holdout","value","data","paysim","precision","transactions","dashboard","training","walk-forward","balance","calibration","detection","false","how","make","money","about","business","features","figures","folds","one","only","per","real","recall","scores","src","stopped","tests","time","amount","cost","cost-optimal","customer","cut-off","drain","each","every","flag","four","frauds","honest","hours","impact.py","license","live","method","out","over","period","pr-auc","rate","score","simulated","